PROPRIETARY — ALL RIGHTS RESERVED, EXCEPT AS STATED

This repository is public so that AuraGIS Pro can download its release assets
without a credential. Publication is not dedication to the public domain and
grants no licence beyond what follows.

Read §2 first if you are here for the archives. It is the largest thing in this
repository and this reservation does not cover it.

1. THE GITHUB FORK GRANT (already given, not revocable once exercised)

   By hosting this repository publicly on GitHub, R&D Colab has granted other
   GitHub users the licence described in the GitHub Terms of Service §D.5:
   a nonexclusive, worldwide licence to view, use, display, perform and
   reproduce this content BY FORKING IT ON GITHUB. Per those Terms, that
   licence survives removal of this repository for anyone who has already
   forked it.

   This file does not purport to withdraw that grant, because it cannot.

2. THE RELEASE ASSETS ARE NOT OURS TO RESERVE

   The .pmtiles archives attached to this repository's releases are
   OpenStreetMap data. Each is an unmodified bounding-box subset of Protomaps'
   daily planet build, which is a Produced Work of OpenStreetMap data.

     Map data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open
     Database License 1.0 — https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

   They contain no R&D Colab intellectual property, and nothing in this file
   claims any right in them. They are redistributed under the same terms they
   arrived under, and any further redistribution must keep that attribution.
   README.md states the position in full, including why the ODbL applies under
   either classification of a vector tile.

   The ODbL binds the database. It does not reach the software that reads it,
   so AuraGIS Pro's own licensing is unaffected — the position ADR-018 records.

3. NO OTHER RIGHTS ARE GRANTED IN THIS REPOSITORY'S OWN CONTENT

   Outside §1 and §2, no licence is given to copy, reproduce, modify,
   republish, mirror, redistribute or make commercial use of this
   repository's own content: README.md, this file, and any scripts,
   manifests or metadata committed here.

4. TRADE MARKS ARE NOT COVERED BY THE GITHUB GRANT

   "R&D Colab", "AuraGIS", and the associated names, logos and marks are the
   property of R&D Colab. The GitHub grant in §1 is a copyright licence and
   conveys no trade mark rights. Forking this repository does not permit use
   of these marks, and they may not be used in any way that suggests
   endorsement by or affiliation with R&D Colab.

   "OpenStreetMap" is a trade mark of the OpenStreetMap Foundation and
   "Protomaps" of its own proprietor; neither is ours to license.

